  "details": "Currently vrc does not change your eye height till you set it greater then or equal to 0.001 Meters more then your current height.\n\nBut OnAvatarEyeHeightChanged still Fires even if you are below that threshold. the playerapi GetAvatarEyeHeightAsMeters will show your height has not changed.\n\nSuggested Behavior is only have it go off when the users height actually changes above that threshold.",
